+## S6 EraStateMachine (GDD § M4, FR10).
+##
+## Owns era state + transitions + legacy flags. The advance trigger (sustain SLA
+## >= 95% + modernize all legacy + no active crisis, AC-E15) + legacy decay are
+## E5.1-E5.3 (S5 — POST the fun-test gate; deferred per the briefing). S0 scope:
